      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3P Coach declined to activate Angelic Page's tap ability during combat, which would give an attacking creature +1/+1 at no mana cost. With the opponent's creatures all having summoning sickness and unable to block, this is free extra damage. Additionally, Feat of Resistance could have been cast to permanently add a +1/+1 counter to an attacker.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Angelic Page or casting Feat of Resistance during combat.",
      "better_line": "Tap Angelic Page to give an attacking creature (likely Baneslayer Angel or Emancipation Angel) +1/+1 for free extra damage. Could also consider casting Feat of Resistance on Baneslayer Angel for a permanent +1/+1 counter.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 295,
      "player": "Gem3P Coach",
      "decision_index": 200,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Declined to chump block Baneslayer Angel (5/5 flying, first strike, lifelink) with a 0/1 Wispweaver Angel illusion token, taking 5 damage (32→27) and allowing opponent to gain 5 life (21→26). While the 0/1 tokens have some future value with Preston's blink/illusion synergies, trading a 0/1 body to save 5 life is usually worthwhile.",
      "action_taken": "No blocks declared, taking 5 damage from Baneslayer Angel.",
      "better_line": "Block Baneslayer Angel with one of the 0/1 Wispweaver Angel tokens to prevent 5 damage. The token has minimal combat value and preserving 5 life points is likely more important than keeping a 0/1 body for future blink synergies.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 298,
      "player": "GPT54 Sport",
      "decision_index": 203,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate Angelic Page to pump Baneslayer Angel during combat. Baneslayer is attacking unblocked (all opponent's creatures have summoning sickness), so tapping Angelic Page would give +1/+1, dealing 6 damage instead of 5 and gaining 6 life instead of 5, at zero cost since Page isn't attacking.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Angelic Page",
      "better_line": "Activate Angelic Page targeting Baneslayer Angel to get +1 damage and +1 life for free. Feat of Resistance could also be considered for a permanent +1/+1 counter, but at minimum the Page activation is pure upside.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 296,
